ank or treasury team that the PAY0001 reversal actually went through and the money came back.\n\n**Not paid:** Evergreen's other open invoice, INV-82317 ($6,926.37), is still a draft awaiting approval. INV-24736 was already paid.", "type": "text"}]}]}